"source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The older of the twin sisters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She had been blind since birth, and because of that, there were times when she envied her younger sister, Arisu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since Arisu had cared for her in place of their parents, Yuri feels deeply indebted to her sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her condition, she was somewhat detached from ordinary society, but after her eyesight was restored, she became much more sociable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As for Arisu's excessive affection toward her, Yuri accepts it with an attitude of, \"Well, I guess it can't be helped.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she has also come to enjoy aspects of it that go far beyond what could reasonably be dismissed with \"it can't be helped.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is able to transform her body to a \"futanari\" as well, though unlike Alice, she cannot produce tentacles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unfortunately, she is perfectly suited to serve as the vessel for ■■■■, making her a one-of-a-kind existence in the universe—someone for whom there is no replacement."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c169759"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d7c709756590635793d329b0b0fcc843747f4fb31327195772a588d1e2ef69c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee1938c6f9029e0bdc8aeaeb482e4468718db9374a2fa3e647e76fb64fd04c84.webp","width":203,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"くすはら ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:102709","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c169760","characterName":"アリス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c169760"},"originalCharacterName":"アリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuri's twin younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since childhood, she has harbored feelings for her sister that go beyond ordinary love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only person she is romantically interested in is Yuri."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After coming into contact with an anomaly known as \"Kami-sama\" , she made a wish for Yuri's blindness to be cured."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Originally, she had no interest in anyone except Yuri, and because she referred to herself by her own name (\"Arisu\") rather than using a normal first-person pronoun, she never managed to make a single close friend she could truly open up to."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she loves pleasure and tends to take the initiative aggressively, she ultimately ends up being overwhelmed by Yuri."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is capable of transforming her body in unusual ways, such as becoming a \"futanari\" or growing tentacle-like appendages."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is compatible as a vessel for the wicked god ■■■■, but unlike Yuri, she is considered replaceable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result, the god treated her as a disposable pawn, but—..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c169760"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b462a644c2acf615f3b6fc4415aa9c0e26c06c139a319b05e066e9e93110929a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca6c9c486da2c25c1be1d044ead817e54e9251b8b2395a4c04c181f50aea7767.webp","width":203,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みる","creatorId":"vndb: